Color schemes for scope tokens in mcedit syntax files

These .sublime-color-scheme files come from third-party projects. Each is
distributed under the MIT license; the copyright notices and the license
text are reproduced below as that license requires.

  ayu-dark, ayu-light, ayu-mirage
      https://github.com/dempfi/ayu
      Copyright (c) 2016 Ike Kurghinyan (Ike Ku)

  catppuccin-frappe, catppuccin-latte, catppuccin-macchiato, catppuccin-mocha
      https://github.com/catppuccin/sublime-text
      Copyright (c) 2021 Catppuccin

  dracula
      https://github.com/dracula/sublime (palette: https://draculatheme.com)
      Copyright (c) 2013-present Dracula Theme

  gruvbox
      https://github.com/Briles/gruvbox
      Copyright (c) 2016 Brian Reilly

  nord
      https://github.com/nordtheme/sublime-text
      Copyright (c) 2016-present Sven Greb <development@svengreb.de> (https://www.svengreb.de)

  rose-pine
      https://github.com/rose-pine/sublime-text
      Copyright (c) Rosé Pine

  solarized-dark, solarized-light
      https://github.com/braver/Solarized
      Copyright (c) 2016 Koen Lageveen

